'''IG-102 '''was one of the two [[IG-100 MagnaGuard]]s, with [[IG-101]],<ref name="CE">''[[Star Wars Character Encyclopedia: Updated and Expanded]]''</ref> that served as [[General]] [[Grievous]]'s [[droid]] [[bodyguard]]s aboard the ''[[Invisible Hand]]'' during the [[Battle of Coruscant]].<ref name="Episode III" /> [[Gender|He]] was programmed to automatically learn combat and refined his combat skills in long training sessions with Grievous. Due to his training, he could wield two [[electrostaff]]s at the same time.<ref name="Altaya">{{EncyclopediaCite|Melee and Ranged Weapons}}</ref>

During the battle above [[Coruscant]], he engaged [[Jedi Master]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] in combat and was beheaded early on in the fight, but remained functioning and able to fight. Eventually, however, Kenobi managed to get inside the MagnaGuard's guard and cleave him in two; his body fell apart with a metallic groan, still grasping feebly at the Jedi.<ref name="Episode III" />

